<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-FINAL EUROPEAN CUP POOL STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FINAL EUROPEAN CUP POOL STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final European Cup pool standings</p>
<p>after Saturday's matches (tabulated under played, won, drawn,</p>
<p>lost, points for, points against, total points):</p>
<p>Pool A</p>
<p> Dax		  4    3    0    1  141   69    6</p>
<p> Bath		 4    3    0    1  136   88    6</p>
<p> Pontypridd	 4    3    0    1   97   60    6</p>
<p> Treviso	    4    1    0    3  106  135    2</p>
<p> Edinburgh	  4    0    0    4   71  199    0</p>
<p>Pool B</p>
<p> Leicester	  4    4    0    0  114   43    8</p>
<p> Llanelli	   4    2    0    2   97   81    4</p>
<p> Leinster	   4    2    0    2   86  109    4</p>
<p> Pau		  4    1    0    3  137  103    2</p>
<p> Scottish Borders 4    1    0    3   80  178    2</p>
<p>Pool C</p>
<p> Brive		4    4    0    0  106   65    8</p>
<p> Harlequins	 4    3    0    1  131   95    6</p>
<p> Neath		4    2    0    2   83  109    4</p>
<p> Ulster	     4    1    0    3   75   87    2</p>
<p> Caledonia	  4    0    0    4  117  156    0</p>
<p>Pool D</p>
<p> Cardiff	    4    3    0    1  135   97    6</p>
<p> Toulouse	   4    3    0    1  157  142    6</p>
<p> Wasps		4    2    0    2  156  115    4</p>
<p> Munster	    4    2    0    2  109  135    4</p>
<p> Milan		4    0    0    4   73  141    0</p>
<p>Quarter-finals (to be played November 16-17):</p>
<p>Dax v Toulouse</p>
<p>Leicester v Harlequins</p>
<p>Brive v Llanelli</p>
<p>Cardiff v Bath</p>
<p>Semifinals: January 4-5, 1997</p>
<p>Final: Date/venue to be announced.</p>
